        "description": {
          "source": "On September 21st of 2019 Torbjörn Lindholm was born in the city of Gothenburg. He had been a bright mind from an early age and had a clear career path in mind, as he pursued multiple advanced degrees at university.",
          "target": "2019年9月21日，托比昂·林德霍姆出生于哥德堡。他自幼聪慧，很早便确立了明确的职业方向，并在大学攻读了多个高级学位。",
          "status": "needs-review"
        }
      },
      "event-d2e97f9e39ed": {
        "sourceHash": "d73d1e390edd8f44d82b05e6096fc61413920545156b64f65936e8195bd428d3",
        "name": {
          "source": "Medical Miracles",
          "target": "医疗 奇迹",
          "status": "needs-review"
        },
        "description": {
          "source": "During the early years of the 21st century, the rapid climate change and growing populations will lead to a series of pandemics across the World. From yellow fever to dengue, pathogens are becoming an ever evolving problem.<br><br>But with hardship and challenges comes progress, and humanity was able to collaborate in speeding up vaccine development, allowing for massive leaps in the medical field, and a period of utopian levels of health and life expectancy.<br><br>As technology advanced, Dr. Elaine Esat would introduce the world to the marvels of cybernetics, empowering humans with mechanical organs and limbs that would later become a global standard, as companies such as Ogundimu Synergies Inc. and Omnica Corp quickly made a name for themselves in the global robotics sphere.",
          "target": "21世纪初，气候迅速变化、人口持续增长，引发了一系列席卷全球的疫情。从黄热病到登革热，病原体不断演化，逐渐成为日益严峻的问题。<br><br>然而，艰难与挑战也带来了进步。人类开始协作，加快疫苗研发，医学领域因此取得巨大飞跃，健康水平和预期寿命一度达到近乎乌托邦的程度。<br><br>随着科技发展，伊莱恩·埃萨特博士向世界展示了赛博义体的奇迹，让人类能够使用机械器官和肢体。后来，这些技术成为全球标准；奥贡迪姆联合公司和全智机械公司等企业也迅速在全球机器人领域崭露头角。",
          "status": "needs-review"
        }
      },
      "event-1261b3ade9a7": {
        "sourceHash": "5e643d47b50852ce71834148dd50860adc49d54d259b5124003dd6bcc96f148a",
        "name": {
          "source": "Crystal Clear",
          "target": "清澈 见底",
          "status": "needs-review"
        },
        "description": {
          "source": "Dr. Leonel Namuaca was working on a revolutionary device which, thanks to nano-filtration systems, managed to greatly improve the cleansing of water from polluted and non-potable sources. Inspired by his life of struggle as climate change forced his family away from home, his purifiers quickly took over the world, helping to stop waterborne illness, and improving water efficiency in regions where it was scarce.",
          "target": "莱昂内尔·纳穆阿卡博士研发了一种革命性装置。借助纳米过滤系统，它大幅提升了从受污染、不可饮用的水源中净化饮用水的效率。气候变化迫使他的家人背井离乡，这段经历激励他继续研究；他的净水器很快推广到世界各地，帮助遏制水源性疾病，并提高缺水地区的用水效率。",
          "status": "needs-review"
        }
      },
      "event-555690bcc0f5": {
        "sourceHash": "f960e0b79fc600cf380808e6944b72a95d8488092c830757bb9dc5371d42ac51",
        "name": {
          "source": "John Francis Morrison is Born",
          "target": "约翰·弗朗西斯·莫里森出生",
          "status": "needs-review"
        },
        "description": {
          "source": "Born on January 27th of 2021, John \"Jack\" Francis Morrison was raised by farmers, and grew up to become a rambunctious teen. When he was not helping on the farm, he spent his time playing football, and by his eighteenth birthday he would choose to enlist in the army, intending to put the strength and discipline from his years of athletics into good use.",
          "target": "约翰·“杰克”·弗朗西斯·莫里森于2021年1月27日出生，在农场家庭中长大，逐渐成长为精力旺盛的少年。他不帮忙务农时就踢足球；18岁生日那天，他选择参军，希望将多年运动训练带来的力量与纪律投入军旅。",
          "status": "needs-review"
        }
      },
      "event-491abcac1c49": {
        "sourceHash": "a2b726857920f7b164353edbc6cab6359d703547f3e8f784d8595892df338bfe",
        "name": {
          "source": "Greener Energy",
          "target": "绿色 能源",
          "status": "needs-review"
        },
        "description": {
          "source": "As technology progressed, many fields of science quickly solved global issues such as illness and water scarcity, but it quickly became clear that the worsening climate of the planet would become the next major obstacle to surpass. Scientists all over the globe scrambled for ideas to produce cost-effective clean energy that could become a worldwide standard.\n\nDr. Justina Borda was one of the first to tackle this issue. A phycologist specialized in genetics, who sought to improve energy equity in her home of Colombia. Borda developed a strain of algae capable of thriving in low oxygen waters and photosynthesizing at disproportionate speeds. And after many attempts, she was able to get the energy produced by the algae to work alongside a Goldilocks Generator, taking the excess of electricity from the algae and essentially transforming any body of water into a solar panel.\n\nBorda's invention spread across the world rapidly, as rural communities quickly standardized its use, to the point that even the most remote corners of the world have bodies of water where their creation managed to propagate. As her invention became the norm, the public moved away from fossil fuels for their daily energy consumption. Borda kickstarted a green energy revolution, and as superstorms became all the more common, the wind energy industry followed, which ultimately led to a decrease in carbon emissions of more than 20 percent during this period, giving humanity hope for a better tomorrow.",
          "target": "随着科技进步，许多科学领域迅速解决了疾病和水资源短缺等全球问题，但人们很快意识到，日益恶化的气候将成为下一个必须跨越的主要障碍。世界各地的科学家争分夺秒，试图研发一种成本可控、能够成为全球标准的清洁能源。\n\n专攻遗传学的藻类学家贾斯蒂娜·博尔达博士是最早迎战这一问题的人之一。她希望改善祖国哥伦比亚的能源公平，于是培育出一种能在低氧水域生存、并以异常速度进行光合作用的藻类。经过多次尝试，她让藻类产生的能源与黄金发电机协同工作，将多余电力转化为能源，几乎把任何水体都变成了太阳能电池板。\n\n博尔达的发明迅速传遍全球。农村社区很快将其标准化应用，甚至最偏远的地区也出现了能够繁衍这种藻类的水体。随着这项发明成为常态，公众逐渐摆脱化石燃料，转向日常清洁能源消费。博尔达开启了绿色能源革命；随着超级风暴日益频繁，风能产业也随之发展。这一时期的碳排放最终下降了20%以上，为人类的美好明天带来了希望。",
          "status": "needs-review"
        }
      },
      "event-2075735df080": {
        "sourceHash": "163c0e32d01de3cda2c748e0597d5d50a7f1d3cb556165ce14017149219af440",
        "name": {
          "source": "Cleaner Oceans",
          "target": "洁净 海洋",
          "status": "needs-review"
        },
        "description": {
          "source": "While humanity was fighting to stop climate change, its effects were already heavily affecting people all over the world, and it was just as important to find solutions for those problems as it was for those to come. Island nations suffered the most from climate change, as the rising sea level and pollution of the oceans put their lifestyle at risk. For years, the people of the Polynesian region requested the international community to take the issue more seriously, but the handling of the situation left a lot to be desired.<br><br>This eventually led to the creation of the Polynesian League, an intergovernmental alliance between New Zealand, the Cook Islands, Samoa and the recently independent Hawaii, where together they would find solutions to the issues affecting their region.",
          "target": "人类努力遏制气候变化时，气候变化的影响已经严重波及世界各地。为这些问题寻找解决方案，与预防未来问题同样重要。海平面上升和海洋污染威胁着岛屿国家的生活方式，波利尼西亚地区受到的冲击尤其严重。多年来，当地民众不断请求国际社会更加重视这一问题，但处理结果始终不尽如人意。<br><br>最终，波利尼西亚联盟成立。这是一个由新西兰、库克群岛、萨摩亚以及刚刚独立的夏威夷组成的政府间联盟，各方共同寻找解决本地区问题的方法。",
          "status": "needs-review"
        }
      },
      "event-4676048c1d77": {
        "sourceHash": "f248f8c837e5a0a7b1ab8d181c69173375a2c6ecaaa021fbc6f0a0451a6f77d7",
        "name": {
          "source": "Out of Thin Air",
          "target": "凭空 稀薄 空气",
          "status": "needs-review"
        },
        "description": {
          "source": "Namuaca's work was later used by Michael Lomakema, who realized purification alone couldn't do much in the absence of water. And he engineered, alongside his college department in the Great Basin Desert, a home printable water extractor, which, combined with Namuaca's technology, allowed people to get clean water essentially out of tin air, extracted from any degree of humidity.<br><br>The work of these two men forever changed the world as we knew it, and would eventually be the key to taking humanity to the stars and beyond.",
          "target": "纳穆阿卡的研究后来被迈克尔·洛马凯马采用。他意识到，没有水源，单靠净化技术无法解决问题，于是与大盆地沙漠地区所在大学的系所合作，研发出一种可在家中打印的取水装置。它与纳穆阿卡的技术结合后，可以从任何湿度的空气中提取洁净水，真正做到“凭空”取水。<br><br>这两位科学家的工作永远改变了人类熟悉的世界，最终也成为人类走向群星、探索更远宇宙的关键。",
          "status": "needs-review"
        }
      },
      "event-ad45a5f689df": {
        "sourceHash": "c09b22918ca26d2401324ec6c721d69fa2c029dc769c9ac27fb9ffa59b8c6aaf",
        "name": {
          "source": "Vivian Chase is Born",
          "target": "维维安·蔡斯出生",
          "status": "needs-review"
        },
        "description": {
          "source": "On January 12th of 2028, Vivian Chase and her twin sister Valentine were born, as daughters of ex-military parents. Unfortunately, Vivian was born with a rare autoimmune disease that caused her body to attack her own organs, which would force her to spend most of her childhood and teenage years bedridden. The time in the hospital gave Vivian a lot of time to read books and play strategy games, as she quickly grew interest in the military like her parents.<br><br>As her condition worsened and threatened her life, her family made the hard choice of admitting her into Dr. Esat's experimental program, where they would replace a vast majority of her body with cybernetics over the years. Vivian lived on, but it would further change the course of her life.",
          "target": "2028年1月12日，维维安·蔡斯与双胞胎姐妹瓦伦丁出生于退役军人家庭。不幸的是，维维安患有罕见的自身免疫疾病，身体会攻击自己的器官，导致她童年和青少年时期大多卧病在床。住院期间，她有大量时间阅读书籍、玩策略游戏，也逐渐像父母一样对军事产生兴趣。<br><br>病情恶化并威胁生命后，家人艰难地决定让她接受埃萨特博士的实验项目。多年间，项目以赛博义体替换了她身体的大部分。维维安活了下来，但这也进一步改变了她的人生轨迹。",
          "status": "needs-review"
        }
      },
      "event-64e22820823a": {
        "sourceHash": "82cb50218d827eb4dae8512a058a9b14dc30d4ccc7683f4ba22c0f5f041d2a83",
        "name": {
          "source": "The Nuclear Solution",
          "target": "核能 方案",
          "status": "needs-review"
        },
        "description": {
          "source": "While green energy was enough to sustain small towns and daily activities for most households, industry at large required a lot more power still, and to solve this, they turned to a familiar solution, nuclear power. While the infamous accidents from the previous decades like Chernobyl and Fukushima made it a hard sell, breakthroughs in fusion reactors allowed for the first Fusion plant to be brought up online, and after that it wouldn't be long before this became the standard for metropolitan areas, government research centers and large industrial facilities.",
          "target": "绿色能源足以支撑小城镇和大多数家庭的日常活动，但整个工业体系仍需要更多电力。为了解决这个问题，人们重新采用了熟悉的方案：核能。尽管前几十年切尔诺贝利和福岛等臭名昭著的事故让核能难以推广，聚变反应堆的突破最终让第一座聚变电站上线。此后不久，聚变能源便成为大都市、政府研究中心和大型工业设施的标准配置。",
          "status": "needs-review"
        }
      },
      "event-3294c57a6ce9": {
        "sourceHash": "8821f61dd7f78531efd9d302f5aa89882fa50fb6c81359feb1fe25665f2f658b",
        "name": {
          "source": "Mako Rutledge is Born",
          "target": "马可·拉特利奇出生",
          "status": "needs-review"
        },
        "description": {
          "source": "On September 12th of 2028, somewhere in the middle of the Australian Outback, Mako Rutledge would be born to a humble family, surrounded by farmers and solar plants, like many others just hopping for a quiet life in the country, and to be left alone.",
          "target": "2028年9月12日，马可·拉特利奇出生在澳大利亚内陆某处的一个朴素家庭。他在农民和太阳能电站的环绕下长大，和许多人一样，只希望在乡间过上安静的生活，不受外界打扰。",
          "status": "needs-review"
        }
      },
      "event-f5d543c3c522": {
        "sourceHash": "cdfb6c97295a7591b10db37d51c450a3307d444e799451c5968bcba0379df97f",
        "name": {
          "source": "The Super Coral Reef",
          "target": "超级 Coral Reef",
          "status": "needs-review"
        },
        "description": {
          "source": "In their search for solutions on the ecological criticism the Polynesian nations eventually landed on the Coral Restoration Initiative, a project led by Dr. Aleluia Taupega who, with the help of his students, created \"Montipora Taupega\", now known as Supercoral. This genetically enhanced coral was extremely resilient to the changing environment and quick to grow to extraordinary sizes. Once introduced, it quickly helped revitalize the coral reefs of the Pacific and, thanks to its unique metabolism, it helped clean the oceans from chemicals and microplastics. The trade-off was that as the Coral consumed any substances in its path, it grew so large it created massive island-like structures above water. While the view is unlike any other place on earth and one of deep ecological and touristic importance, the expanding size of the reefs also leads to the blocking of many trade routes, causing international inconvenience and scandal.",
          "target": "波利尼西亚各国寻找生态危机解决方案时，最终启动了珊瑚修复计划。该项目由阿莱卢亚·陶佩加博士领导；他与学生们共同培育出“陶佩加鹿角珊瑚”，如今被称为超级珊瑚。这种经过基因强化的珊瑚极其耐受环境变化，并能快速生长到惊人的规模。引入海域后，它迅速帮助复苏太平洋珊瑚礁；独特的新陈代谢还可以吸收海水中的化学物质和微塑料，净化海洋。<br><br>代价是，珊瑚会吞噬沿途的各种物质，生长到足以在海面上形成巨大岛屿般的结构。珊瑚礁的景观独一无二，具有深远的生态和旅游价值，但不断扩张的礁体也堵塞了许多贸易航线，引发国际不便与争议。",
          "status": "needs-review"
        }
      },
      "event-9c82c857822e": {
        "sourceHash": "7f3b8c60a6859a215462235743f6517ae2031dd7327e3857b2659aeb4ab2519e",
        "name": {
          "source": "Rising Tides",
          "target": "上升 潮汐",
          "status": "needs-review"
        },
        "description": {
          "source": "As supercoral grew in the Pacific, the people of the Atlantic faced similar problems as Polynesia once did. The coasts of Portugal were facing great erosion and violent waves as the ocean level rose and acidification worsened, but they would find a solution on their own thanks to the ingenuity of the Martins couple.\n\nCláudio Martins was a wealthy Portuguese entrepreneur, married to a Venezuelan ecological activist, Hector Martins. The pair were known for their inventions, and together they used their resources to propose to the Portuguese Government to begin the construction of a giant sea wall.\n\nThe Wall was to be made out of Durovidro, a synthetic material Cláudio himself had invented years earlier. Not only was it nearly as tough as a diamond, but it also had the unique quality of neutralizing acidity, which made it perfect for both solving the rising tides eroding the coast, and preserving the ecosystems around the area. The Durovidro Sea Wall was a massive success after its first prototype, and it slowly expanded over the years.",
          "target": "超级珊瑚在太平洋生长的同时，大西洋沿岸也遭遇了与波利尼西亚相似的问题。海平面上升、海水酸化加剧，葡萄牙海岸正受到严重侵蚀和猛烈海浪冲击；马丁斯夫妇凭借才智找到了自己的解决方案。\n\n克劳迪奥·马丁斯是一位富有的葡萄牙企业家，他的伴侣赫克托·马丁斯则是来自委内瑞拉的生态活动家。两人都以发明创造闻名，他们利用自身资源，向葡萄牙政府提议修建一座巨型海堤。\n\n海堤采用杜罗玻璃制造，这种合成材料由克劳迪奥多年前发明。它不仅坚硬得近似钻石，还能中和酸性物质，既适合抵御侵蚀海岸的上涨潮汐，也能保护周边生态系统。杜罗玻璃海堤的首个原型大获成功，随后逐年扩建。",
          "status": "needs-review"
        }
      },
      "event-1afe56d09ee8": {
        "sourceHash": "cc986be345fd25d4fee2bd76e2a2f2e8748ca6e2bdfc4408cc9052a4ad820019",
        "name": {
          "source": "Moira O'Deorain is Born",
          "target": "莫伊拉·奥德莱恩出生",
          "status": "needs-review"
        },
        "description": {
          "source": "On April 4th of 2029, Moira O'Deorain was born. Growing up with a fascination for bugs and science, surrounded by several advancements in genetics at a very young age, it was not a surprise to anyone when she ended up at the University of Dublin, becoming a brilliant yet controversial geneticist.",
          "target": "2029年4月4日，莫伊拉·奥德莱恩出生。她从小就对昆虫和科学着迷，身边又有许多基因学领域的新突破，因此后来进入都柏林大学，成为一名才华横溢却极具争议的遗传学家并不令人意外。",
          "status": "needs-review"
        }
      },
      "event-8f71e20b013b": {
        "sourceHash": "5969654a8e0f90f470c1b43532bfd1dbbe8304c7302bf4b6f078a6341022d6b6",
        "name": {
          "source": "Solar Threading",
          "target": "太阳 织线",
          "status": "needs-review"
        },
        "description": {
          "source": "The people of the Andean Mountains came up with their own solutions to clean energy. In the sacred valley of Peru, the Paraqina research group combined modern technology with the ancestral traditions and beliefs of the natives, funding heavy research into hydraulic and wind energy as well as agricultural techniques.\n\nBut by far their biggest accomplishment would come with the invention of solar threading, a unique way of harvesting condensed solar energy into beams of light. This technology was so strong that it was capable of giving power to nearly everything around the city of Runasapi and the surrounding areas. The group grew in numbers and research expanded into multiple other fields, eventually leading into cybernetics, where they found a way to engrave solar threads into human bodies, allowing people to directly harness the power of the sun onto themselves, and channel them into different tools. The few selected for this procedure would become the first of the mythical Inti Warriors, the protectors of the city, their technology and their new-found way of life in the isolated mountains of Peru.",
          "target": "安第斯山脉的人们也找到了自己的清洁能源方案。在秘鲁的圣谷，帕拉奇纳研究小组将现代科技与当地原住民的祖传传统和信仰结合起来，大力研究水能、风能以及农业技术。\n\n但他们最伟大的成就，是发明了太阳织线：一种把凝聚的太阳能收集并转化为光束的独特方式。这项技术足以为鲁纳萨皮城及周边地区的几乎所有设施供能。研究小组不断壮大，研究范围也扩展到其他领域，最终涉足赛博义体。他们找到把太阳织线刻入人体的方法，使人能够直接吸收太阳能，并将其导入不同工具。少数接受这一手术的人成为首批神话般的因蒂勇士，守护着秘鲁孤立山城的城市、技术和新生活方式。",
          "status": "needs-review"
        }
      },
      "event-e33743aa134c": {
        "sourceHash": "9a13ae097c8a73fd94bd405631a2b3a8125c4a09f655ee8902a7a47fa6cf1322",
        "name": {
          "source": "Wuxing University",
          "target": "五星大学",
          "status": "needs-review"
        },
        "description": {
          "source": "With all the new technologies that were arising, academic institutions were constantly growing, as more people wanted to enter the many new technological fields that were opening, and one of the schools that quickly took the lead in the world would be Wuxing University. According to the academy's teachings, centuries ago, a wise family had dedicated themselves to the understanding and application of the traditional Wuxing philosophy, and the study of the building blocks of the world. With the years of accumulated knowledge, they founded what later became the University, where traditional wisdom was to pioneer new science, for students to have all the knowledge of the past available to guide their future.\n\nThe University, true to its name, splits its fields of study into five categories, relating to the phases of the Wuxing teachings.\nThe Fire College, for the study of martial arts and defensive strategies.\nThe Metal College, for robotics and technological engineering.\nThe Water College, for traditional medicine and applications into new medical advancements.\nThe Earth College, for agricultural and sustainability studies.\nAnd Wood College, for civil and environmental engineering.\n\nEach of these faculties played major roles in China's major advancements during the following decades, quickly increasing the College's prestige across the world.",
          "target": "随着新技术不断涌现，学术机构持续壮大，越来越多的人希望进入层出不穷的新科技领域。其中，五星大学很快成为世界领先的学府之一。根据学院传承，数百年前，有一个智慧家族致力于理解和应用传统五行哲学，研究构成世界的基本要素。经过世代积累，他们创建了后来发展为五星大学的学院，让传统智慧开创新科学，也让学生能够以过去的知识指引未来。\n\n五星大学名副其实，将专业分为与五行教义相对应的五个学院：研究武术与防御策略的火学院；研究机器人与技术工程的金学院；研究传统医学及其现代应用的水学院；研究农业与可持续发展的土学院；以及研究城市与环境工程的木学院。\n\n在随后的几十年里，每个学院都为中国的重要进步发挥了关键作用，五星大学的声望也迅速传遍全球。",
          "status": "needs-review"
        }
      },
      "event-a7e2c7af29e0": {
        "sourceHash": "e4d921360b8cae5c50179c3c77399d674b190a604405444d8f0077f1834b5cde",
        "name": {
          "source": "Akande Ogundimu is Born",
          "target": "阿坎德·奥贡迪姆出生",
          "status": "needs-review"
        },
        "description": {
          "source": "On May 25th of 2031, Akande Ogundimu was born in Oyo, Nigeria. He was the heir to Ogundimu Synergies Incorporated, which was making a name for itself in the field of cybernetics at the time. This background led to a mentality of conquest and progress in the young man, as he soon found himself learning a wide spectrum of martial arts, hoping to pursue a professional career as a fighter.",
          "target": "2031年5月25日，阿坎德·奥贡迪姆出生于尼日利亚奥约。他是奥贡迪姆联合公司的继承人；当时，这家公司正在赛博义体领域崭露头角。这样的成长环境让年轻的阿坎德形成了征服与进取的心态，他很快开始学习广泛的武术，希望以格斗家为职业。",
          "status": "needs-review"
        }
      },
      "event-73b5d784adf8": {
        "sourceHash": "b81517dbb147c7937bd96be912ce46d64c0bb393d83b5bedcdea75286bd1575e",
        "name": {
          "source": "Emre Sarioglu is Born",
          "target": "埃姆雷·萨里奥卢出生",
          "status": "needs-review"
        },
        "description": {
          "source": "On November 8 of 2034, Emre Sarioglu was born. A kind, social and stickler of the rules soul that would grow up to become a Local Hero, serving in the Special Forces for Turkey, where his natural leadership and sharp tactical mind shined. He made sure to build relationships with everyone around him, remaining close to his old squad mates even after years.",
          "target": "",
          "status": "needs-review"
        }
      },
      "event-13752c7c13ae": {
        "sourceHash": "a8d53ef48d5510a68e9bd57697e97f74e0cb07be5f7c854b3d6fb45fe68f2ea2",
        "name": {
          "source": "Hardlight for the World",
          "target": "硬光 世界",
          "status": "needs-review"
        },
        "description": {
          "source": "Dr. Vishwakarma Bhatt had worked for a long time on an ambitious project in Bengaluru, trying to find a method to essentially solidify light. The project had taken years and many of those in his discipline moved on, but Bhatt persisted until he finally got a working prototype. His Photon Projectors were capable of altering photon reactivity, coaxing them into binding, creating crystalline structures, capable of bonding with carbon, forming a durable physical object made out of carbon fibers. This would be known to the world as Hardlight.\n\nThe project was slow but promising, and thanks to the United Nations Global Recovery Program, he would get the grants needed to kickstar Vishkar, and lead his team in researching ways to use this technology in infrastructure. Bhatt envisioned a future where Hardlight would solve housing shortages, transportation issues and material inequity. He always wished for this technology to remain accessible to the public, as a gift to the world.\n\nUnfortunately, a tragic car accident would end his life, and the company would move on without him, away from his altruistic philosophy. Exactly one year after Bhatt's death, Vishkar made its first public offerings.",
          "target": "",
          "status": "needs-review"
        }
      },
      "event-f19262d81cc8": {
        "sourceHash": "387ad85a241200eb78890d52844bb7c59d5f63104733f70673e774d0ca2013d1",
        "name": {
          "source": "Mei-Ling Zhou is Born",
          "target": "周美灵出生",
          "status": "needs-review"
        },
        "description": {
          "source": "On September 5th, 2036, Mei-Ling Zhou was born in Xi'an China. Growing up a shy and anxious young girl during such an environmentally turbulent time period led to her developing a strong belief in preserving the world for future generations.",
          "target": "",
          "status": "needs-review"
        }
      },
      "event-7013808657f9": {
        "sourceHash": "32bb7d6674e898e003658ed9130fec064f400108ec924a33060b252fef3cf52c",
        "name": {
          "source": "The Rise of Omnics",
          "target": "崛起 智械",
          "status": "needs-review"
        },
        "description": {
          "source": "Omnica Corporation started from humble beginnings and quickly rose up as a multinational entity, with an annual budget larger than some nations. Thanks to their early support of Esat's cybernetic projects, alongside heavy investment into nuclear sciences, the company got a quick start on advanced robotics and quickly, innovating in manufacturing and automation for years until they were able to present the world with the first set of commercial Automated Robotic Assistance units, later colloquially known as \"Omnics\".\n\nOmnics were highly advanced Ais that came in many forms, though largely humanoid, and with enough capability for learning and adapting to many different situations, making them have mass appeal as domestic caretakers, companions and substitutes for all kinds of hard labor. Omnics started to appear everywhere, going from more crude, voiceless models first only affordable by the upper class, to fully personable voiced iterations, mass produced for people all over the world.\n\nAs the company grew, and their Omnics became more and more common, they started to commission their Omniums, massive fully automated factories designed to pump out units continuously. Many cities were more than happy to welcome the company, as they wanted to have the latest in Omnic technology available first. Omnica was on top of the world, and yet their biggest achievement would still await them.",
          "target": "",
          "status": "needs-review"
        }
      },
      "event-f6c7a535fff0": {
        "sourceHash": "c26afc5d3e68a052c88f4f92befde052169025a079e70adff4cd725829adab33",
        "name": {
          "source": "Elizabeth Caledonia is Born",
          "target": "伊丽莎白·卡利多尼亚出生",
          "status": "needs-review"
        },
        "description": {
          "source": "On October 1st of 2037, Elizabeth Caledonia was born outside of Bellaire. Elizabeth grew up in the Lead Rose Manor, coming from a privileged family of old money. Her family worked in many fields, consulting powerful CEOs around the world, but were mainly known for their ownership of the Arbalest Arms Company, a 19th century weapon manufacturer.\n\nBecause of their busy schedule, the adults in the house barely ever paid attention to the little Elizabeth, leading to her often feeling alone and often getting into trouble getting back at her parents. The only one that was truly there for her was the family's butler, B.O.B., a Bouncer Omnic Unit, one of the earliest on the market.",
          "target": "",
          "status": "needs-review"
        }
      },
      "event-6e12e2dcaa23": {
        "sourceHash": "9bd8324cf0df5d5de2a020c5f46bd3e117544596a5309543bb4452dd8f5b0bd3",
        "name": {
          "source": "Hanzo Shimada is Born",
          "target": "岛田半藏出生",
          "status": "needs-review"
        },
        "description": {
          "source": "On November 3rd of 2038, Hanzo Shimada is born. The firstborn heir of Sojiro, head of the Shimada clan in Hanamura. An ancient family and clan of assassins that grew a criminal empire across Japan through arms trafficking and protection services to the people they ruled over.\n\nDue to his position, he trained since very young to take his father's role as the leader of the clan. He also had fond memories of his mother Rumiko at this age.",
          "target": "",
          "status": "needs-review"
        }
      },
      "event-412b9598bc3f": {
        "sourceHash": "232f5664670b4d436f577bfbdc5264cef855709ae7717a863f75fe021257833b",
        "name": {
          "source": "Nourishing the World",
          "target": "滋养 世界",
          "status": "needs-review"
        },
        "description": {
          "source": "Climate change heavily affected the agricultural industry, as many crops will stop being viable, leading to farmlands across the world becoming deserted. As humanity risked famine across the board, GMOs seemed like the obvious solution, especially after the success of Borda's Algae and Taupega's Supercoral, which heavily reshaped public opinion on artificially enhanced life.\n\nAs the first set of genetically modified crops began to solve the farming problem, it was precisely their mass appeal that caused harsher regulations on their use, for both safety and privatization reasons. Mega-corporations leading this push for artificial crops kept a tight leash on their licensing, leading to multiple lawsuits and price fixing, as farmers couldn't compete with the improved crops, and yet also couldn't afford the seeds themselves.\nThis whole ordeal came to a stop in court, when Matthew Frank, a Manhattan lawyer, convinced the Supreme Court that bio-engineered seeds couldn't be held under a patent or copyright, because they were transformative works of an indigenous species. It also helped to his case that, during the pandemics and outbreaks of the previous decades, the rush to get vaccines ready lead to a lot of patents getting dismissed for the sake of saving lives.\n\nThanks to this historic legal victory, the GMO crops became effectively open sourced, and with it, effectively solving world hunger. The rise of these highly effective crops led to corporate farmers, who would partner with Omnica Corporation to use a robotic workforce, leading to more efficient, but larger megafarms that quickly encompassed most of the world's arable lands. It was business ventures like this that led to Omnica's advertising motto: \"Putting power in your hands\".",
          "target": "",
          "status": "needs-review"
        }
      },
      "event-503aadef874b": {
        "sourceHash": "0e7a44793a14ef766bc4f25c8e622171de998ca194bcaab00a95e127a2567b26",
        "name": {
          "source": "Angela Zeigler is Born",
          "target": "安吉拉·齐格勒出生",
          "status": "needs-review"
        },
        "description": {
          "source": "On May 13th of 2039, Angela Zeigler was born in Zurich. Medicine ran in the family, and during the crisis, her parents would often serve as volunteers in local hospitals to aid those in need. Sadly, however, both of them were killed in an air strike during these visits. Orphaned in dire times and at such a young age, this gave Angela a very strong and vocal distaste for war.",
          "target": "",
          "status": "needs-review"
        }
      },
      "event-cdecabda0996": {
        "sourceHash": "bc69cb1a27c6f24ef5045421610b628f036dccf87525a1869a3998f9a9aa58e9",
        "name": {
          "source": "Cole Cassidy is Born",
          "target": "科尔·卡西迪出生",
          "status": "needs-review"
        },
        "description": {
          "source": "On July 31st of 2039, Cole Cassidy was born. Records of his early life are scarce and unreliable, as the man enjoyed the mystery atmosphere he leaned onto. It's believed he came from Texas, and like many others, got orphaned by the Crisis at an early age. Due to these dire circumstances, he never finished formal schooling, leading him to a job hoping to survive, and eventually a life of crime.",
          "target": "",
          "status": "needs-review"
        }
      },
      "event-914e3a98adce": {
        "sourceHash": "546e34e3e29f404501cb0d75b94962a3c0fd4fd1a1ceb5b6f3a009aeb07c1236",
        "name": {
          "source": "Voslkaya Industries",
          "target": "沃斯卡娅工业",
          "status": "needs-review"
        },
        "description": {
          "source": "In Russia, Alisa Volskaya would return home after graduating as an engineer at MIT, and soon after she would serve in the Russian Defense Forces. Thanks to her ingenuity, she would be tasked with developing weaponry for the RDF, and to do so she would create the robotics manufacturing company, Volskaya Industries. Alisa was quite a quiet inventor, and while she enjoyed her craft and providing for the military, she never sought to grow the corporation privately.\n\nAlisa would innovate in the name of Russia for years, but her most ingenious ideas would stay private until the Crisis, where she would finally get the chance and the money to make them a reality.",
          "target": "",
          "status": "needs-review"
        }
      },
      "event-31dcb5a3c49b": {
        "sourceHash": "7b74a415c510388e22059ce51fc74ed0e7da68eafbb883d1be37a212b8b362ba",
        "name": {
          "source": "Lindholm Style",
          "target": "林德霍姆风格",
          "status": "needs-review"
        },
        "description": {
          "source": "During his time studying at Linköping University, Torbjörn met a chemical engineer student, Ingrid, who would go on to become his future wife. At the time, she was working with biogenic textiles using a modified Darwin's bark spider hybridized with many species of limpets to produce elastic threading. The result was strong, fire retardant and resistant to electric and acid damage. While she hoped her creation would become a common material used in many fields, it was phenomenally expensive, costing several thousands of dollars per quater ounce, and none of her research subjects lived for more than a year.\n\nIngrid was about to retire her idea when she met Lindholm, who took a look at her project and saw several practical applications on small amounts of fibers, using them for advanced circuits.  Torbjörn's ingenuity saved Ingrid's project for a new life, and they continued to partner as she finished her degree. She found Torbjörn to be a charming, bright conversationalist and not long after leaving college they would marry. While she did not pursue further work in her field following university, her expertise made her a vital component in the early formation of Overwatch years later, and she grew close with many of the agents.",
          "target": "",
          "status": "needs-review"
        }
      },
      "event-f4448bef7fa0": {
        "sourceHash": "cc239a12c8b22c395ec35123b28286d523be355505f112933b9773727961d052",
        "name": {
          "source": "Jean-Baptiste Augustin is Born",
          "target": "让-巴蒂斯特·奥古斯丁出生",
          "status": "needs-review"
        },
        "description": {
          "source": "On March 12th, 2041, Jean-Baptiste Augustin is born. Baptiste was one of the 30 million children that the Crisis orphaned, growing in an orphanage at Port du Paix with his childhood friend, Roseline Mondésir. Dreaming that one day the two of them could build a clinic for their neighborhood.",
          "target": "",
          "status": "needs-review"
        }
      },
      "event-533f3c581d2a": {
        "sourceHash": "d7fef4db4968adc20e1744c56f078c2618d9b461d87ba5e0530401ab8b636d30",
        "name": {
          "source": "Grasping Gravity",
          "target": "掌握 重力",
          "status": "needs-review"
        },
        "description": {
          "source": "New sources of energy and pushes for cleaner solutions lead to many developments in the field of transportation, and the man leading the race would be a fresh graduate Dr. Siebren De Kuiper, pioneer of gravitational research, as he believed that gravity was the greatest untapped resource humanity had, and one yet to conquer. For years his studies in The Hague pushed ideas to harness the power of gravity and led to many inventions that changed the world forever, most notoriously, the magnetic levitaitonal systems that most holocars and holobikes use in modern day, as well as the technology that would eventually lead to the creation of the Transcontintental Hyperloop, administered by Omar Takama, later known as the head of the Ministry of Transport at Oasis University.\n\nSiebren's work made flying cars not only a possibility, but a very standard form of living across the world, closing the gap between fossil fuels and a truly sustainable future.",
          "target": "",
          "status": "needs-review"
        }
      },
      "event-230ded86e2c5": {
        "sourceHash": "798466157aaecc0478b6a1fd248912de8dca6e3e95469777f4006b5bed414961",
        "name": {
          "source": "Maugaloa Malosi is Born",
          "target": "毛加洛阿·马洛西出生",
          "status": "needs-review"
        },
        "description": {
          "source": "On August 19th, 2041, Maugaloa Malosi was born in Apia, Samoa. His childhood was defined by a love for his country's natural beauty, especially with the rise of Supercoral, as well as a heavy disrespect for the law, which he got from his father. From an early age, Mauga learned that charisma opens doors, and violence gets answers.",
          "target": "",
          "status": "needs-review"
        }
      },
      "event-f66153cb506e": {
        "sourceHash": "b3fb3db41405fc767b9a925f32bb0812059750d4ad8f80cc5be87f8983c8b72a",
        "name": {
          "source": "Genji Shimada is Born",
          "target": "岛田源氏出生",
          "status": "needs-review"
        },
        "description": {
          "source": "On October 28th of 2041, Genji Shimada was born in Hanamura, Japan. The second son of Sojiro Shimada, raised by the sword just like his older brother, Hanzo. An ambidextrous young boy, Sojiro gave him the nickname \"Sparrow\", becoming Genji's own Sparrowhawk feather calling card.\n\n Although Genji never showed the same level of conviction as his older brother, often slacking off and indulging in a playboy lifestyle. Even afterwards, Hanzo became very close to his father, especially after their mother Rumiko Shimada abandoned the family.",
          "target": "",
          "status": "needs-review"
        }
      },
      "event-c7ea9b7487fe": {
        "sourceHash": "f3850ab41ff719f2e6958c7862b96d88fcf29ba926e2b8782d9326c255d1c407",
        "name": {
          "source": "Resource Management",
          "target": "资源 管理",
          "status": "needs-review"
        },
        "description": {
          "source": "The world had overall become a better place, with more available food, miracle cures for all kinds of medical problems, cleaner energy solutions, highly advanced but complex transport systems, and an abundance of machinery helping on all kinds of tasks around the world. But with these perks, came complexity, and with all of these resources available, the global population also grew immensely. Humanity would soon become overwhelmed by the task of managing all of these sectors on a global scale the traditional way. It was here when God AIs got conceptualized.\n\nHighly advanced artificial intelligence systems will be developed across the world. While most AIs were limited by their processing and resources, a God Program was designed to have full global control and authority over specific aspects of industry in modern society. Among many others, there was Xibalbá, in Mexico City, charged with the management of energy equity across the region. Chernobog in Helsinki, Finland, with a high focus on global security and international affairs. Macaria from Brigeport, Connecticut, in charge of communication systems across the States, and the most infamous of them all, Anubis from Cairo, Egypt, made to pursue ecological solutions for the preservation of life.\n\n\nWhile their power allowed humanity to take a back seat as the world moved forward, many skeptics worried that these God Programs were given too much power, and had too much leeway to make decisions, and to calm these fears. Each God Ai was under a constant feedback loop by a dedicated team of programmers that provided its maintenance and supervision, allowing humanity to catch any possible mistakes or concerning choices before it was too late.",
          "target": "",
          "status": "needs-review"
        }
      },
      "event-7b1c9a654db8": {
        "sourceHash": "68226c9c5c7a766dce8ffc51d9abfac5a7a3bb398bd5244947f6a2657a68d4e4",
        "name": {
          "source": "Automation",
          "target": "自动化时代",
          "status": "needs-review"
        },
        "description": {
          "source": "With the introduction of God Programs the world had essentially been set to automatic. On a smaller scale, less complex AIs were able to control local traffic, stocking stores, and manage public work projects, among other things, while on a global level, the God Programs handled these resources and many more with an international perspective in mind, ensuring equity, efficiency and progress. \n\nIt was not just God AIs making life easier, as by this point Omnics were common household items. They impacted everyday life across the vast majority of nations, becoming the main workforce in multiple manual labor fields, which resulted in the loss of many jobs at first, but with God Programs allowing for global scale choreographing of resources, they were able to identify the areas of need and ensure equity and new opportunities around the globe. During this period, the world's population grew rapidly, and when combined with the medical and ecological advancements of the last decades, it allowed for a sense of prosperity and wonder for all of humanity. After years of struggle and discovery, it felt as if anything was possible.",
          "target": "",
          "status": "needs-review"
        }
      },
      "event-f04572472e67": {
        "sourceHash": "f38ec15b48bb1d8ec00e80258c90f2772d4a839438fba57e71281acad1d73d77",
        "name": {
          "source": "Amélie Guillard is Born",
          "target": "艾米丽·吉拉德出生",
          "status": "needs-review"
        },
        "description": {
          "source": "On November 19th, 2043, the young girl once known as Amélie Guillard was born in Annecy, France. Part of an influential family, growing up in the ancestral Chataeu Guillard in the rural areas of France, where the crumbling building accumulated cobwebs and spiders, which both fascinated and terrified her as a kid.\n\nAmelie's life was cold and filled with pressure from a conservative family, which expected her to live by aristocratic traditions. She would go on to become a well-accomplished ballet dancer in Paris.",
          "target": "",
          "status": "needs-review"
        }
      },
      "event-8b664d402fdc": {
        "sourceHash": "19f9f1fb4f4feb2b3efe974d875c3bdb5d6181a2e06a59195f0dce8931549c9b",
        "name": {
          "source": "Lost to the past",
          "target": "湮没于往昔",
          "status": "needs-review"
        },
        "description": {
          "source": "While still in school, Jack would come across certain person while putting out a fire at a lab. Vincent was an archeologist he met while attempting to replicate an ancient beer recipe for his class project. The man was a firm believer in learning from the past, and figuring out the things that were not written down and got lost to time.\n\nWhile the two of them were cleaning up the mess left by the experiment, they quickly hit it off, and Vincent invited him to have a taste of the beer once it was ready. Jack and Vincent would go on to date for years while finishing school and during Jack's time in the military, but as Jack climbed through the ranks it created friction between them, as he had hoped for a normal life with him, and Jack would not do anything beyond continuing his duties.",
          "target": "",
          "status": "needs-review"
        }
      },
      "event-5d73c563e3cc": {
        "sourceHash": "f83db0491a61de79baaf87456728480d3ead6d848ac504b08ce25d876e2e07d6",
        "name": {
          "source": "Responsability",
          "target": "责任",
          "status": "needs-review"
        },
        "description": {
          "source": "Fresh out of college, Torbjörn Lindholm joined SST Laboratories, an independent firm focused on defensive systems. Lindholm joined with the objective of using his skills to save lives. Everything was meant to protect people. During his time in the Labs, the team would design the E54 Siege Automaton Bastion, a mobile artillery capable of reconfiguring themselves to fit the current needs of the situation. The Bastions were a weapon, but they were a weapon meant to be used by human hands. People were always meant to be giving orders.\n\nBut as AI advanced, with Omnics becoming the standard in most fields and God Ai controlling almost every aspect of people's lives, the superiors at SST Labs thought it would be best for Bastion units to be controlled by Military AI, granting these machines more or less fully autonomy. Torbjörn naturally fought this, as opaque technology like this needed human guidance, it was merely a tool and to needlessly complicate it beyond its intended function risked it making the wrong choices and putting humanity in danger.\n\nBut in a world where AI had literally grown to dominate the world, Lihdholm's words caried little weight. This difference in beliefs made him leave the project, deciding not to meddle with things he didn't understand, as with so many variables he risked becoming a Destroyer of worlds. In the years following, he would begin to publicly speak against the growing reliance on Artificial Intelligence, becoming rather passionate about the issue, and gaining many enemies in the process.",
          "target": "",
          "status": "needs-review"
        }
      },
      "event-1280935596ae": {
        "sourceHash": "b733f381b7f32037e31ce30f1286d7ae2cd0e396a16198fe4c1caff41e8b4a57",
        "name": {
          "source": "Upgrades",
          "target": "升级",
          "status": "needs-review"
        },
        "description": {
          "source": "Vivian went on to live a turbulent life due to her many cybernetics. While the technology was miraculous, and had become fairly common, it was still met with discrimination and backlash from many over the years. Notoriously, cybernetics would be outright banned from major athletic competitions, due to the very clear advantage these gave to their users.<br><br>Conversely, cybernetics also opened doors for many, as the enhanced abilities and modifications to equipment made cybernetics very appealing to armed forces around the world. Dr. Esat herself objected against the weaponizing of her technology, as she intended for it to save lives, but that did not stop the Canadian Military from admitting enhanced soldiers into their ranks.<br><br>Vivian enlisted at the age of 16, coming from a family of veterans, she developed a fascination for the military. She served in the primary reserves and graduated with a BA in Psychology and a MA in Political Science, later pursuing the Canadian Special Forces.",
          "target": "",
          "status": "needs-review"
        }
      },
      "event-b27457700c1c": {
        "sourceHash": "7e5ba2a4c124f9343549e3e827d6d680193b25b09e3d8ccc0394b09a90c8356f",
        "name": {
          "source": "Freja Skov is Born",
          "target": "弗蕾娅·斯科夫出生",
          "status": "needs-review"
        },
        "description": {
          "source": "On September 6th of 2044, Freja Skov was born in Copenhagen. As the daughter of a diplomat in Denmark, she would go on to see how her mother's choices and work saved hundreds of lives during the coming Crisis. While Freja attended key meetings with her mother, she always wanted to have a more active role in saving people, rather than sitting behind a desk. As she grew older, she would pursue Criminology at university.",
          "target": "",
          "status": "needs-review"
        }
      },
      "event-2ac0c37887a2": {
        "sourceHash": "1a66397cbf13400c0fb5ba8f673b34de5e7282640f723aca88d9ad1d4c1f35df",
        "name": {
          "source": "Road to the Stars",
          "target": "道路 群星",
          "status": "needs-review"
        },
        "description": {
          "source": "Like many other fields of science, astronomy had taken massive leaps over the years, with the monitoring of near-earth objects becoming so advanced, that it allowed humanity to avoid and divert the course of extinction-level asteroids and telescopes were becoming so accurate that many mysteries of old had been solved, and with those new ones arrived.\n\nAt the center of all of these developments was Lucheng Interstellar, a Chinese corporation that had envisioned humanity's future in the stars, developing plans for long-range space travel over the years. But before this was possible, they needed to pursue further research into the long-term effects of low gravity on living organisms. In order to do this, they partnered with many scientists across the world, including the Indian Space Research Organization, which had been developing massive mag-lev satellite launchers for years. Thanks to IRSO's launching tracks, Lucheng would be able to speed up the construction of their first major milestone in the stars, the Horizon Lunar Colony.",
          "target": "",
          "status": "needs-review"
        }
      },
      "event-dbb779a0c671": {
        "sourceHash": "37441a3f698933e19dc4568a05d41eee2af795508e794a79b66c2cc1bbe7159f",
        "name": {
          "source": "Fareeha Amari is Born",
          "target": "法芮尔·阿玛莉出生",
          "status": "needs-review"
        },
        "description": {
          "source": "On April 15th, 2045, Fareeha Amari was born. Years earlier, the now legendary Sniper, Ana Amari met Sam English, a Canadian diplomat of First Nations descent, and dated casually in between their respective jobs, but would be caught by surprise when it turned out Ana was pregnant. The pair settled down in Cairo to take care of Fareeha.",
          "target": "",
          "status": "needs-review"
        }
      },
      "event-38d2e06948c5": {
        "sourceHash": "f7a989ac4bad6efb23e76931cf88ee486aec4feca3b88a67eee35d35cf736fe2",
        "name": {
          "source": "Space Race",
          "target": "太空 竞赛",
          "status": "needs-review"
        },
        "description": {
          "source": "In order to survive in space, many logistics need to be solved and, much like before, the advancements made to accommodate the Colony would find many different uses across the world. Textile manufacturing for long-term space suits would be used by many workers down on earth due to their similar properties to Kevlar, saving many lives during the crisis. Medical advancements in radiation shielding lead to further research into cancer treatments, also applicable on Earth. A similar case happened for treatment of lower bone density and tissue rejuv…146694 tokens truncated…"status": "needs-review"
    },
